# pop'n music 13 カーニバル, NET TAISEN between two HIRAKU cabinets on one LAN cable (lancable.h),
# as popn12-nettaisen-a/-b.his: each from a save with e-AMUSEMENT on (popn13-eamuse-on.his; no
# event phase needed: 13 and 14 open the mode with game get's net_event 2), no card.bin yet. A new
# card's credit as popn13-card-new.his up to the PIN; the mode wheel one to the left (Button 4) to
# NET対戦, red; the explainer skipped (red); ROOM SELECT to its timer; song select while the lobby
# looks. B, 300 frames behind, heard A's broadcast at its card's OK, so it is first asked 全国対戦 or
# 店内対戦 (nationwide or in-shop) and, left to its timer, takes 全国対戦. A waits in the lobby, B
# joins it; a CPU takes the third seat; the song starts on both at once, each player pressing a
# button every 10 frames (A from button 1, B from 5), and both RESULTs have all three scores.
game popn13
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5500 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 5560 press "P1 Button 5" 10
